\title{AnophelesEntoTrials: Estimate the Impact of Malaria Vector Control Interventions Based on Entomological Data}
\description{
The AnophelesEntoTrials R package provides a platform to estimate the impact of malaria vector control interventions based on entomological data using MCMC models. It supports fitting Bayesian models to Entomological Hut Trial (EHT) data to estimate intervention efficacy parameters including repellency, pre-prandial killing, and post-prandial killing.
